      "content": {
        "heading": "Rangkuman",
        "points": [
          "゛ membuat konsonan bersuara: k→g, s→z, t→d, h→b.",
          "゜ khusus baris H: は→ぱ.",
          "じ = ji, ぢ = ji, づ = zu (ぢ dan づ jarang dipakai)."
        ]
